      // The SAME credential-free licence gate as base: the Hub repo is public (no token), and
      // `requiresLicenseAcknowledgment` blocks every tier's download behind an in-app accept that
      // surfaces `licenseNotice`. The accept is per MODEL — accepting base's notice does not
