      // RTX PRO 6000 (Blackwell sm_120) at 1024²/4-step CFG-off via the candle-gen-qwen-image edit offload A/B
      // harness (qwen_edit_probed_generate_for_offload_ab + QWEN_EDIT_LIGHTNING=1, device-level idle-gated
