      // Iris-3B (epic sc-25678, story sc-25679) — the GENERATION task of speridlabs/iris-3b: a
      // pixel-space (no VAE) flow-matching DiT conditioned on 12 intermediate layers of
      // Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct, served natively by inference's `mlx-gen-iris` (`iris_3b`).
