      "candle": {
        // Conservative DECLARED floors (no measurement campaign), the Candle twin of the MLX value
        // above: bf16 backbone (~6 GB) + Qwen3-VL-4B text encoder (~8.9 GB) resident plus 1024²
        // pixel-space activations. Existing inference CUDA real-weight runs on an RTX PRO 6000
