        // 38106019178 ran at 512². Only the staged row below was measured (one bounded run, not a
        // calibration), hence `measured: false`.
        // * `minMemoryGb` — like every padded Candle floor it folds in the 2 GB allocator reserve
        //   (21.4 + 2.0 = 23.4, rounded up to 24), because `vram_gate::predicted_peak_gb` adds no
        //   headroom to this scalar. Without it the fit gate had no prediction and admitted a load on
