        "label": "Iris 3B",
        "description": "Speridlabs Iris-3B text-to-image: a 3B pixel-space flow-matching DiT (no VAE) conditioned on Qwen3-VL-4B. Native MLX on Apple Silicon and Candle/CUDA on Windows/Linux NVIDIA; 100-step FlowDPM-Solver++ at CFG 3.0 by default. Downloads ~12 GB backbone + ~8.9 GB text encoder; needs ~32 GB unified memory on a Mac, or ~16 GB VRAM on an NVIDIA GPU at 1024² (staged: the text encoder is dropped before denoising; ~24 GB keeps it resident).",
