      // so the convert affordance and converted-state probe apply off-Mac too) and re-verifies both component
      // snapshots against their pinned sizes + sha256 (`FLAN_T5_BASE` / `SD_VAE`). SceneWorks does
      // not re-implement any of it. Generation then reads only local files: the bundle is the
      // LoadSpec weights dir and the two co-requisites are staged as `LoadSpec::components`
      // (`text_encoder`, `vae`) by the generic `attach_required_components` — nothing downloads at
