        "label": "Supra2-IMG",
        "description": "SupraLabs Supra2-IMG text-to-image: a small 104M-parameter rectified-flow DiT conditioned on Flan-T5-Base and decoded by SD VAE ft-MSE, rendering 256x256 images. Native MLX on Apple Silicon and Candle/CUDA on Windows/Linux NVIDIA; 50 Euler steps at CFG 3.0 by default. Downloads ~417 MB checkpoint (converted on install) + ~993 MB text encoder + ~335 MB VAE.",
