    // turnkey `SceneWorks/bernini-mlx` snapshot (downloaded once; the HF cache dedupes the
    // shared repo, like z_image_edit reusing the Z-Image-Turbo weights). The worker forces
    // `frames:1` + `video_mode:"t2i"|"i2i"` so the engine returns a single still
