          // (sc-19708) so those routes carry a real catalog artifact through the typed
          // model-source seam: install state, external-library availability, and the
          // worker's pre-loader guard all key on this exact revision + file pair. The
          // revision is byte-for-byte the worker's own `INSTANTID_MLX_REVISION`
          // (`image_jobs/instantid.rs`) — they MUST agree, mirroring the real_esrgan
