      // Audio Studio default request (verse + chorus, 2 segments x 3000 tokens, CFG on, a dual 60 s reference, the default 0-30 s window):
      // q4 / q8 / bf16 peak = 6.35 / 8.94 / 13.78 GiB above the card's baseline (CUDA context included;
      // max of the 500 ms nvidia-smi and 20 ms device series). Floors = ceil(peak x 1.25) per tier (the
      // qwen_image_2_1 rule); the scalar is the densest tier, the fallback for an unlisted tier. These
      // describe the default request only: longer songs and ICL windows are admitted or refused per
      // request by the worker's yue_admission gate (its CUDA lane is calibrated on the same run).
      // Metal (not read from this block — Apple silicon is gated by yue_admission's unified envelope):
      // 10.53 / 15.72 / 16.71 GiB lifetime-max footprint on an M-series Mac, ceil(x1.25) = 14 / 20 / 21.
