      "ui": {
        "label": "YuE Japanese / Korean ICL",
        "description": "YuE (m-a-p/YuE-s1-7B-anneal-jp-kr-icl) lyrics-to-song model for Japanese / Korean lyrics — full songs with vocals from structured lyrics ([verse] / [chorus] …) and genre tags, rendered segment by segment (7B stage-1 LM + 1B stage-2 LM + xcodec + Vocos). Returns a 44.1 kHz mix plus separate vocal and instrumental stems. Conditions on a reference clip (in-context learning): a single-track mix, or a dual-track vocal + instrumental pair, over a chosen time window. bf16 / q8 / q4 tiers (q4 by default). Candle-native on every platform. Apache-2.0 (HKUST / M-A-P).",
