    {
      // YuE2 (epic sc-22988, sc-22998) — the EXPERIMENTAL, NONCOMMERCIAL symbolic-plan song generator,
      // offered BESIDE YuE1 (epic sc-19373, family `yue`, ids `yue_{en,zh,jp_kr}_{cot,icl}`), never in
      // place of it. Everything that identifies it is disjoint from YuE1 (epic E1): catalog id + engine
      // provider id `yue2` (candle-audio-yue2 `provider::PROVIDER_ID`, never an alias of YuE1's six
      // `yue_*` generators), family `yue2`, and its download/cache namespace — the three UPSTREAM
      // `m-a-p/YuE2*` repositories at their pinned revisions, never a `SceneWorks/yue-*` re-host. There is
      // no upgrade, fallback or rename edge between the two families anywhere: `commercialUse` below only
      // POINTS a commercial-use route at YuE1, it never reroutes a request (model_usage_policy.rs).
      //
      // LICENCE (epic E2 / E7). Weights: CC BY-NC 4.0 (YuE2-3B, YuE2-Vae, YuE2-Vae-legacy). The
      // `qwen.tiktoken` tokenizer inside the YuE2-3B repo is byte-identical to Qwen/Qwen-7B's and is under
      // the Tongyi Qianwen License Agreement, NOT the weight licence (candle-audio-yue2
      // `license::LICENSE_QWEN_TIKTOKEN`). The first-party GitHub source SceneWorks' native engine is
      // ported from is Apache-2.0. `requiresLicenseAcknowledgment` makes the API refuse the download until
      // the user accepts `licenseNotice`; About -> Licenses carries `yue2`, `yue2-qwen-tiktoken` and
      // `yue2-source`. No YuE2 file is re-hosted: the engine's licence gate refuses Redistribution until an
      // owner records a basis, so every row here fetches the upstream original.
      //
      // CLOSURE (epic E7; candle-audio-yue2 `inventory::Closure::Generation`). Base generation needs
      // exactly YuE2-3B (+ its `qwen.tiktoken`, same repo) and ONE decoder. The two decoders are one
      // `choice` group: install queues only the chosen one (standard by default) and the other stays an
      // add-on (LoadSpec components `vae` / `vae_legacy`). `files` name every pinned file of each
      // component (weights, configs, model card, LICENSE and notices — the engine verifies all of them by
      // size + SHA-256), and nothing else: the repos' remote Python, wheels and demo assets are excluded
      // (`inventory::EXCLUDED`).
      //
      // TIERS (epic E8). bf16 is the released checkpoint. q8 / q4 are NOT artifacts of their own: each row
      // downloads the SAME bf16 original and declares `localDerivation` — the worker derives the tier on
      // the user's machine through the engine's audio-lane preparer (`candle_audio_yue2::prepare`, i.e.
      // `tier::convert`) and the engine verifies it against `tier::TIER_PINS` before loading. bf16 is the
      // default because it is the only tier that needs no local derivation; every tier downloads the same
      // bytes.
      //
      // COVERS. SheetSage2 + MERT-v2-FullSong (`Closure::Cover`) are conditional cover dependencies, not
      // generation downloads, so they live in `conditionalComponents`, never in `downloads`: no install,
      // tier or co-requisite path fetches them. They are acquired only for covers, through
      // `POST /api/v1/models/yue2/conditional-components/cover/download`, under the SAME licence
      // acknowledgment and noncommercial policy as YuE2 (the repo-keyed download doors allow them with
      // the acknowledgment and refuse them without it). Owner decision, epic sc-22988, 2026-09-27: the
      // native transcription port (inference `candle-audio-sheetsage2`) is distributed under CC BY-NC
      // 4.0 — the upstream weight terms — noncommercial only, attribution per its NOTICE. The pinned
      // identity is each row's revision, file list and weights SHA-256 (the engine verifies every file
      // by size + SHA-256 against `inventory::SHEETSAGE2` / `MERT_V2_FULLSONG` before it loads).
      //
      // Memory admission / floors are sc-23001; the API + worker jobs are sc-22999; the UI is sc-23000.
      "id": "yue2",
      "name": "YuE2 Song Generation (Experimental, Noncommercial)",
      "family": "yue2",
      "type": "audio",
      "macOnly": false,
      "experimental": true,
      "nonCommercial": true,
      "requiresLicenseAcknowledgment": true,
      "license": "CC-BY-NC-4.0",
      "licenseNotice": "YuE2 is an EXPERIMENTAL model offered for NONCOMMERCIAL use only. Its weights (YuE2-3B and the YuE2-Vae / YuE2-Vae-legacy decoders, by Multimodal Art Projection) are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0): the licence grants use for NonCommercial purposes only — \"not primarily intended for or directed towards commercial advantage or monetary compensation\" — and requires attribution whenever the material is shared. The qwen.tiktoken text tokenizer in the same repository is Alibaba Cloud's Qwen tokenizer under the Tongyi Qianwen License Agreement, which the weight licence does not replace. Covers from a recording also use SheetSage2 and MERT-v2-FullSong (by Multimodal Art Projection; weights CC BY-NC 4.0), downloaded only when you set up covers; SceneWorks' native transcription code ported from them is distributed under the same CC BY-NC 4.0 terms, noncommercial only. SceneWorks downloads these files directly from the upstream m-a-p repositories (it does not re-host them); a q8 or q4 tier is derived on this machine from that original. For commercial use, choose YuE1 (the separate YuE lyrics-to-song models) instead; that choice concerns the model weights only and does not clear rights in your lyrics, reference recordings or generated audio.",
      "licenseUrl": "https://huggingface.co/m-a-p/YuE2-3B/blob/1a96eca688d6ae5d7f0feb88573fec89920fcd19/LICENSE",
      "commercialUse": {
        "eligible": false,
        "reason": "YuE2's weights are licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0, which permits NonCommercial use only; no commercial licence from the rights holder (Multimodal Art Projection) is recorded.",
        "alternativeFamily": "yue",
        "alternativeNote": "YuE1 is the intended commercially licensed lyrics-to-song option. Choosing it concerns the model weights only; it does not clear rights in your lyrics, reference recordings or generated audio."
      },
      "audio": {
        "sampleRates": [48000],
        "supportsMultiSpeaker": false,
        "supportsGuidance": true,
