      // Metal working set (KV allocator padding, process reserve and retained high-water) and the
      // CUDA card (device + its separate 2 GiB allocator reserve), in whole GiB
      // rounded up. The runtime gate is that admission itself, per request against the live budget —
      // never these numbers; `yue2_admission::tests::the_catalog_floors_are_the_estimators_*` keeps them
      // equal to its derivation. Saved sc-23002 observations bound the Metal reserve; `measured`
      // remains false while terminal calibration (config/yue2-memory-profile-plan.json) is incomplete.
