      "ui": {
        "label": "YuE2 (Experimental)",
        "description": "EXPERIMENTAL · NONCOMMERCIAL (CC BY-NC 4.0). YuE2-3B plans a song as a two-voice ABC score, then generates its semantic and acoustic tokens and decodes 48 kHz stereo through the YuE2 VAE (standard, or the legacy decoder as an add-on). A separate model from YuE1, the commercial-use lyrics-to-song option — never a substitute for it. bf16 is the released checkpoint; q8 / q4 are derived on this machine from it, not re-hosted. Candle-native on every platform. Source Apache-2.0; weights CC BY-NC 4.0; qwen.tiktoken under the Tongyi Qianwen License Agreement.",
